(R/'fact-retention-map.md').write_text('''# Backend 12 retention review
All 10 entries, 35 questions, every field/lead/body/variant and the full OS IO and foundations supplements were read. Catalog-selected entries match preflight. All original IDs, source metadata, anchors, images, link targets and question order remain unchanged. Exact duplicate introductory paragraphs alone were removed. per-entry-dispositions.json covers all primitive leaves; retention-map.json records each text/HTML block; source-span-map.json carries exact guarded edits.

- Web: CSRF cookie conditions, CORS/read versus send, SSR application/json escape, proxy right-to-left trust, all SSRF address/connection/redirect budgets, SSE CRLF/BOM/EOF/retry/NUL, MCP2025-11-25, id103/j-7/60 event remain. The missing inline SSE example now explicitly points to the existing field table. WebRTC retains ICE/DTLS/SRTP, 2Mbps→600kbps, 48/90kHz, audio96000→144000 and video900000→990000, 32-bit wrap, sync versus latency, 10000/9999 subscription distinction, recordings, ASR and media privacy.
- Containers: QEMU q35/TCG/1GiB/2CPU/snapshot/no-network command retained as a diagnostic example; namespace/cgroup/security boundaries, rootless Podman versus Docker, quotas/limits, cpu.max200000/100000, 500MB/1GB heap counterexample, K8s scheduling AND/OR/ignored execution, taint/toleration, PDB voluntary interruption, Docker overlay Swarm/attachable and 2377/7946/4789 protocols retained.
- Design: config notification broadcast versus consumer competition, re-read race, persistent expiry scanner/fencing/banVersion, Java/Go conditional choices, WorkManager cancellation and cache generation/TOCTOU/private roots, cross-loop pooling owner lifecycle/NullPool retained. Expanded answer-first Java/Go lead without inventing a user choice.
- Diagnostics: 137 not proof of OOM, SIGKILL/finally limits, NGINX defaults versus loaded configuration, GDB 16-byte half-open dump and typed pointer arithmetic, environment/shell status snapshot, CRC32C versus IEEE, on/off CPU, bounded perf99Hz/10s and packet128B/100 examples retained. GDB lead now answers diagnostic workflow.
- Files: every VFS/inode/dentry/FD/open-description distinction, links/unlink/physical-erasure limit retained. 1GB RAM/2GB file versus sparse2GiB+17, tail5/8KiB, sendfile sizes0/1/4095/4096/65539 and997 loop, mapping/append/force/directIO/userfaultfd/hint constraints retained. NANDFTL/TRIM/flush and SSD measurement conditions retained. N+1 uint64 offsets, 8(N+1), billion-lines8GB, 64KiB scan, LF/CRLF/bareCR, strict UTF8, pread, fileidentity/TOCTOU, close exception aggregation, O(L), fixedK compression, wheel/CI/benchmark contract all preserved. Explicit Python3.11+ added for exception groups; former empty supplemental headings now contain their retained conditions.
- Foundations/hardware: OS components, embedded versus backend full comparative prose and honest experience boundaries retained. CPU caches/pagecache/DRAM versus JVM heap, 100M×4B=381.5MiB, RV32I, k+N−1 pipeline, 32KiB/64B/8way=64sets and6/6bit cache model retained.
- IO: Linux6.12 epoll rbr/rdllist/ovflist, O(logN)/O(K), select1024 and FD1500, LT/ET100/10/90 and oneshot, wait/read wakeup boundaries retained. Supplement retains 100tasks/5slots versus100processes×5=500, promise1000/32 versus worker100/5, all callback/microtask/CJS/ESM variants, Electron isolation, latest256/0..100000/1000await, ordered10000 slots/getter limits, weak references, Java21/24, PythonGIL/free-threaded, GoGMP, and all Windows synchronization/abandonment distinctions.
- IPC: semaphore/futex wait race, banker assumptions/proof/O(n²m) and both3-unit examples, all pipe/PIPE_BUF/mq/shm/AF_UNIX variants, optimistic versus pessimistic/ABA/spin budgets, process-shared attributes, 32-byte Java21/Linux mapped counter and complement/overflow/force/lifetime remain.
- Process: Java8 API target versus JDK21 runtime, three I/O workers, UTF8 index/value protocol, O(n), process versus business termination, argv option injection, k2 explanation versus k3 latch pressure, null/negative/overflow/duplicate identities and O(k) outstanding delivery window remain. Detached implementation/test claims became validation designs.
''')
